OL,3,GNEWSAHigh street's temporary bus stops
OL,4,Alead to confusion
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus passengers say temporary bus stop
OL,7,Fchanges have left them frustrated and
OL,8,Fconfused, with some giving up on
OL,9,Fservices entirely.
OL,11,FSeveral stops in Witney have been moved
OL,12,Fas part of the high street enhancement
OL,13,Fscheme, which is widening pavements and
OL,14,Fmaking the town centre more pedestrian
OL,15,Ffriendly.
OL,17,FMaps have been put up showing where the
OL,18,Fnew stops are, but passengers said
OL,19,Fthey're not clear enough.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
