OL,3,GNEWSAHigh street's temporary bus stops
OL,4,Alead to confusion
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council said: "Local
OL,7,Fbus operators are working with us to
OL,8,Fimprove the information on-site and to
OL,9,Fhelp people plan their bus journeys."
